ch beyond “a point in a pre-existing emptiness.” I’m not asking you to accept it on faith. I’m just laying out the shape of the only model that matches everything we’ve measured. You don’t have to like it, and you don’t have to pretend that it feels normal. But I wanted to show you that you’re not being ignored or philosophized at—your question hits the exact, hardest part of the science.
